# Dispatch two distinct drivers. Walk to the second hatch from the commander's start.
key 2
key 1
wait 300
key 4
wait 300
key 6
wait 300
key 6
wait 300
key 3
wait 100
key 5
wait 95
expect section 1
hold S 20
hold A 96
key E
expect vessel lintel-2
key 8
shot second-lintel
checkpoint second-aboard
# The first driver's gate instruction is pending. From the second tank identify its own driver in the register.
key C
key PageDown
key PageDown
key PageDown
key 5
key Right
key 6
key Escape
key Escape
wait 65
expect vessel lintel-2
expect guard 1
expect dispatch lintel-2@move@gate
checkpoint both-drivers
